OL,3,GNEWSACouncil urged to speed up sale of
OL,4,Abuildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals to "accelerate" the sale of
OL,7,Fseveral public buildings in Wakefield
OL,8,Fare to be put to senior councillors,
OL,9,Fwho will be asked to approve the plans.
OL,11,FBetween 100 and 150 assets owned by the
OL,12,FReform-led authority could be
OL,13,F"realistically" sold over the next two
OL,14,Fyears, according to a report due to go
OL,15,Fbefore the council's Cabinet on 22
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
