OL,3,GNEWSACouncil urged to speed up sale of
OL,4,Abuildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FFeasibility work had already started on
OL,7,Fthe potential sale of Pontefract
OL,8,FMunicipal Offices, Castleford's Five
OL,9,FTowns Resource Centre and Queens House,
OL,10,Fin Wakefield city centre, the report
OL,11,Fstated.
OL,13,FThe council, which has a portfolio of
OL,14,Fmore than 1,600 properties, said it had
OL,15,Fmade #6.5m from the sale of 18 assets
OL,16,Fduring the last financial year.
